# Exactly three small, fictional speech fixtures for developer/Mac testing.
# Never expand this exception to real hearing recordings.
!/fixtures/audio/explicit-support.mp3
!/fixtures/audio/multi-bill-conditional.mp3
!/fixtures/audio/legislator-role-change.mp3

